abstract: >-
  Desktop PyQt6 + PyQtGraph application showing a live filtered Channel 0
  waveform and Welch PSD (0-50 Hz) from a simulated 32-channel OES-32 SciPy
  pipeline (50 Hz notch + 0.5-45 Hz bandpass). Research prototype; synthetic
  stimuli only.
keywords:
  - oes32
  - telemetry
